<title>USA: PictureTel and GTE sign pact.</title>
<headline>PictureTel and GTE sign pact.</headline>
<dateline>ANDOVER, Mass. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PictureTel Corp and GTE said Tuesday they signed a multi-year co-branding agreement in which GTE has agreed to resell, under private label, PictureTel's SwiftSite compact videoconferencing system.</p>
<p>Extending the two companies' ongoing alliance to provide videoconferencing products and services to GTE customers, the agreement also marks the first time that GTE has co-branded a videoconferencing system, a statement from the companies said.</p>
<p>PictureTel announced a similar pact with Philips Electronics NV earlier Tuesday.</p>
</text>
